## 6. diff / backup 接口

## `PkgInclude`

`src/lib/diff.ts:27-32`：

```ts
export interface PkgInclude {
  pkgSubPath: string;
  targetSubPath: string;
}
```

把 `assets/` 下一个 subtree 映射到 target subtree。

## `DiffPlan`

`src/lib/diff.ts:45-56`：

```ts
export interface DiffPlan {
  modified: Array<{
    relPath: string;
    fromHash: string;
    toHash: string;
  }>;

  added: Array<{
    relPath: string;
    toHash: string;
  }>;

