- 第10步 channel-specific（约200-230行）：codegraph changed 判断改为基于 decision.adopt + decision.editResults：
```ts
const codegraphTouched = Array.from(decision.adopt).some(p => p.startsWith(".pi/extensions/codegraph/"))
  || decision.editResults.some(e => e.relPath.startsWith(".pi/extensions/codegraph/"));
```
