═══════════════════════════════════
第 6 步：错误处理
═══════════════════════════════════
- resolveUpgradeActions 抛错（含 inquirer ExitPromptError/Ctrl-C）被 upgradeCommand 的 try/catch（包裹 step7-11 的那个）包住→process.exitCode=1。因决策层在 backup 之前调用，抛错时无 backup 残留。给决策层调用点单独加 try/catch 也行，输出"user cancelled — no changes made, no backup created"。
